aged Ethernet Network Switch","stats":[{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Special Price : 25,000৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Regular Price : 26,000৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 425","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"XikeStor","href":"/xikestor","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"SKS7300-4X4T","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"25,000৳","old":"26,000৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax: 25,000৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"425","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: SKS7300-4X4T","c":[]},{"h":"4x 10G RJ45 Interfaces","c":[]},{"h":"4x 10G SFP+ Interfaces","c":[]},{"h":"Switching Capacity up to 160Gbps","c":[]},{"h":"Full Metal Body","c":[]},{"h":"Silent FAN Cooling","c":[]},{"h":"Supports VLAN Segmentation and Port Aggregation","c":[]},{"h":"Support LACP Function","c":[]},{"h":"Input Power: DC 12V 3A","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"1219\">The <strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"913\">XikeStor SKS7300-4X4T 8-Port 10G SFP+ Uplink L2 Managed Ethernet Network Switch</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"959\">high-performance networking solution</strong> designed for <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1022\">enterprise, ISP, and data center environments</strong>. Featuring <strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1068\">4x 10G SFP+ fiber uplink ports</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1120\">4x 10G SFP+ and&nbsp; 10GBase-T copper combo ports</strong>, it delivers <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1179\">ultra-fast and reliable data transmission</strong> for bandwidth-intensive applications.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1541\">With advanced <strong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1270\">Layer 2 management capabilities</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1344\">VLAN, QoS, LACP, IGMP Snooping, and Spanning Tree Protocol</strong>, this switch ensures optimized traffic control and secure network segmentation. Its <strong data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1461\">rack-mountable metal chassis</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1494\">low-noise cooling system</strong> make it perfect for continuous 24/7 operation.</p><h3 data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1573\"><strong data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1571\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"2102\"><li data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1610\">\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1610\"><strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1586\">Model:</strong> XikeStor SKS7300-4X4T</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1709\">\n<p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1625\"><strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1623\">Ports:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1709\"><li data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1662\">\n<p data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1662\">4x 10G SFP+ fiber uplink slots</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1709\">\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1709\">4x 10G SFP+ / 10GBase-T RJ45 combo ports</p>\n</li></ul>\n</li><li data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1751\">\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1751\"><strong data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1735\">Switching Capacity:</strong> Up to 160Gbps</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1816\">\n<p data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1816\"><strong data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1774\">Forwarding Rate:</strong> Wire-speed performance across all ports</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1870\">\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1870\"><strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1834\">Management:</strong> L2 Managed (Web GUI, CLI, Telnet)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1953\">\n<p data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1953\"><strong data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1894\">Network Features:</strong> VLAN, QoS, LACP, Port Mirroring, STP/RSTP, IGMP Snooping</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2063\">\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2063\"><strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2015\">Cooling:</strong> Low-noise or fanless design (model dependent)</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2135\"><strong data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2133\">Compatibility:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2310\"><li data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2203\">\n<p data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2203\">Compatible with all standard 10G SFP+ transceivers (SR, LR, ER)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2233\">\n<p data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2233\">Supports DAC &amp; AOC cables</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2310\"><p data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2310\">Suitable for high-speed LAN, data center core, and ISP fiber aggregation</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco Nexus 9300 N9K-C93180YC-EX 48x 10/25GbE SFP28 + 6x 100GbE QSFP28 Network Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-9300-n9k-c93180yc-ex-48x-1025gbe-sfp28-6x-100gbe-qsfp28-network-switch","now":"155,000৳","old":"160,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ L3 Web Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-l3-web-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"24,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco Nexus N3K-3064PQ-10GX –48-Port 10G SFP+ Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-n3k-3064pq-10gx-%E2%80%9348-port-10g-sfp-switch","now":"70,000৳","old":"75,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba Networking CX 8325-32C 32-Port 100G QSFP+/QSFP28 Data Center/Core Switch","href":"/hpe-aruba-networking-cx-8325-32c-32-port-100g-qsfpqsfp28-data-c